'''Vampire's Gun''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2024 Halloween Box]] in the [[Halloween Event 2024|2024 Halloween Event]].

==Appearance==
Vampire's Gun is a reddish color. It looks like a pathbringer with intricate gold patterns on the barrel and chamber, the front of the barrel has a blood red texture.

==Trivia==
*It partners with the [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife [[Vampire's Axe]], making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Vampire's_Set Vampire's Set].
*It is also part of the Full Vampire's Set with [[Vampire's Axe]] and [[Vampire's Edge]].
*It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Vampire's Gun]], which can be found in the same box.
*It also came out along with the [[Spirit]] and [[Soul]] gamepass.

